      "title": "Growington Ventures India Limited Announces Resignation of Abhimanyu Kumar as Independent Director and Member of Committees, Effective January 20, 2026",
      "body": "Growington Ventures India Limited announced that Mr. Abhimanyu Kumar (DIN: 01497152) has submitted his resignation as Independent Director of the Company with effect from January 20, 2026, due to personal and unavoidable circumstances. The Board meeting to record the resignation was held on January 21, 2026. Consequently, he shall also cease to be a member of the Audit Committee, Nomination and Remuneration Committee, Stakeholders Relationship Committee, Risk Management Committee, and Sexual Harassment Committee of the Company.",
